  judgment-obligation
    defined-by concept
    role judgment-obligation
    role scoped-grammar-pattern
    precondition "a request clause asks for a quality no observable check decides"
    effect "independent task acceptance keeps the clause as explicitly unresolved judgment, never as satisfied (issue #1166)"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "follow best practices and idioms"
    lexeme en "best practice" "best practices" "idiom" "idioms" "idiomatic" "conventions" "simple" "straightforward" "clarity" "clear" "readable" "clean" "properly" "correctness" "standard library" "meaningful"
    lexeme ru "лучшие практики" "идиомы" "соглашения" "простой" "простым" "понятный" "понятные" "ясность" "стандартную библиотеку" "чистый" "осмысленное" "осмысленный"
