  applicability-marker
    defined-by concept
    role applicability-marker
    role scoped-grammar-pattern
    precondition "a request clause applies only where it is applicable"
    effect "independent task acceptance keeps the clause required and notes its applicability condition (issue #1166)"
    unit "not applicable"
